      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like im overreacting. my friend went to the er for something similar and it was literally just a pulled muscle from a gym session. i think i'm just stressed. if i take a really strong dose of aspirin and a couple of Advil, won't that help with the inflammation and the pain? i'm pretty sure i can just manage this at home if i just stay still and relax for the night. it can't be that serious just from a flight, right?",
